# Test Cases: Disaster Relief Volunteer Portal

This document lists **all test cases** to verify the functionality of the Disaster Relief Volunteer Portal.

---

## **1. Help Request Form**

| Test Case ID | Test Case Description                   | Steps                                                                 | Expected Result                                           | Status |
|--------------|----------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|--------|
| TC-HR-01     | Submit help request online              | Fill all form fields and submit while online                          | Request is sent to backend and confirmation received     | Pass/Fail |
| TC-HR-02     | Submit help request offline             | Turn off internet, fill form and submit                                | Request is queued locally, queued count increases        | Pass/Fail |
| TC-HR-03     | Auto-sync queued requests               | Reconnect internet after offline submission                             | Queued requests are automatically sent to backend       | Pass/Fail |
| TC-HR-04     | Form validation                         | Submit form with missing or invalid data                                | Appropriate error message is displayed                  | Pass/Fail |

